Based on the SceneDesignerAgent's sandbox report, I have all the information needed to design the milestone. The emerald ore is placed at spawn-relative coordinates (4, 1, 6), on the western face of a stone formation in the back-right area of the room. The task is "find emerald_ore" — a find/locate/observe task.

```json
